00:38:58,193 --> 00:38:59,444
Walking the right-of-way.

558
00:38:59,527 --> 00:39:00,904
How am I doing?

559
00:39:01,404 --> 00:39:03,031
You're doing okay.

560
00:39:03,072 --> 00:39:05,366
I told you
I was a good walker, bro.

561
00:39:11,664 --> 00:39:12,582
Boom!

562
00:39:12,665 --> 00:39:14,167
Give me another one.

563
