568
00:39:35,480 --> 00:39:36,773
No.

569
00:39:38,691 --> 00:39:39,567
Bye.

570
00:39:39,651 --> 00:39:41,819
You're fucking
unbelievable, bro.

571
00:39:45,156 --> 00:39:47,534
