want to grab a beer.

572
00:39:47,617 --> 00:39:49,452
No, thanks.

573
00:39:49,536 --> 00:39:51,037
You gotta get over
the bar thing.

574
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:52,205
Seriously.

575
00:40:10,306 --> 00:40:14,060
